"E<.Ar output_file> E<.Nm ssh-keygen> E<.Fl I Ar certificate_identity> E<.Fl "
"s Ar ca_key> E<.Op Fl hU> E<.Op Fl D Ar pkcs11_provider> E<.Op Fl n Ar "
